| RISC3DSetup: Configure's plug-in for RISC3D (which 3D driver is in use,
| and what it offers programs)
Set RISC3DSetup$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <RISC3DSetup$Dir>.!Sprites
IconSprites <RISC3DSetup$Dir>.CoSprite
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error RISC3D's Configure page needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error RISC3D's Configure page needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 1024k -max 1024k
Run <RISC3DSetup$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
